{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226040","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226040","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1222604001:1":{"text":"埠頭でグレイヴボーンを見たという噂が広がってな、今や大騒ぎになっている。","source_cn":"有人在码头看见了亡灵，这消息传开后引发了很大的骚动。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB787E1E5FDD992A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222604002:1":{"text":"目撃者はデイヴという漁師だ。何十年も前からラスティーアンカーで暮らしている。","source_cn":"那个倒霉的目击者叫老戴夫，是个渔民，在锈锚港生活了好几十年。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x934F15D67C263770","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222604003:1":{"text":"奴とは何度か話したことがある。気は短いが、根は正直だ。ありもしないことをでっちあげるような男じゃない。","source_cn":"我以前跟他打过交道。他虽然性子暴躁，但正直本分，不是那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E1D64A4DAC37E3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222604004:1":{"text":"だったら、デイヴさんは本当のことを言っているのかも。彼と直接お話できますか？","source_cn":"按你说的，这位老戴夫应该没撒谎，我们能否和他直接聊聊呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89AEB01910CE38A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222604005:1":{"text":"もしかしたら、彼が見たのはグレイヴボーンではなくて、何かの魔物だった可能性もあります。","source_cn":"说不定只是一场误会，也许他看到的并不是亡灵，而是某种魔物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEBB963F677E8433","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222604006:1":{"text":"そうだな。宿屋で会う約束をしている、そろそろ時間だ。行こう。","source_cn":"嗯。我跟他约好了在旅店碰头，时间差不多了，我们这就去找他吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30D9570C4E04463B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"ルカ","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}